# Live runtime STATE is never tracked by git (2026-09-19 decision; see docs/DECISIONS.md).
# It used to be tracked as a "durable record", but git commands in the working tree
# (checkout, commit -a, add -A) can revert or delete live files -- that happened once.
# Durability now comes from dated snapshots (~/backups), not from git.
